        "avatar": "https://storage.sajalchoudhary.net/avatars/fefe79d6135555ec3d97ad3f7c5e0802.jpg"
      },
      "content": "<p><a href=\"https://framapiaf.org/@pmevzek\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@pmevzek</a> yeah that was my worry too, perhaps more than the cost.</p>",
      "url": "https://mastodon.social/@sajal24x7/116934583454615759",
      "published": "2026-07-17T09:22:23.051Z",
      "status": "approved"
